    the G10 bezel case is a composite good,
        as stated in ruling NY N363522 at "(fiberglass-reinforced epoxy) plastic composite rear housing and a machined front bezel".
    the G10 rear housing of the G10 bezel case is a component of the G10 bezel case,
        as stated in ruling NY N363522 at "(fiberglass-reinforced epoxy) plastic composite rear housing and a machined front bezel".
    the G10 bezel of the G10 bezel case is a component of the G10 bezel case,
