    the essential character of the G10 bezel case is given by the G10 rear housing of the G10 bezel case,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N363522 at "the plastic that would impart the essential character to each case as it provides the impact protection and predominates",
        because "the plastic provides the impact protection and predominates over the bezel materials (GRI 3(b))".
    the principal use of the G10 bezel case is protecting a mobile phone,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N363522 at "and they are all described as a two-part fitted protective case for the iPhone 17 Pro / 17 Pro Max",
