% NY N363253 (July 2026): a bowl clamp from China.
scenario ny_n363253 is:
    the self-feeding bowl clamp is a manufactured article,
        as stated in ruling NY N363253 at "“Dymmoy Self-Feeding Bowl Clamp.” It is a reusable and washable feeding accessory designed for babies and toddlers that are six months of age and older".
    the self-feeding bowl clamp is made of plastics,
        as stated in ruling NY N363253 at "acrylonitrile butadiene styrene (ABS) plastic along with internal metal components which support the internal".
    the principal use of the self-feeding bowl clamp is securing a feeding bowl,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N363253 at "This article is used to secure a separate feeding bowl to a dining table or highchair tray during",
        because "the clamp is not of the same class or kind as the tableware and kitchenware exemplars of EN 39.24 because it functions as a clamp (as in N269773)".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the self-feeding bowl clamp is 3926.90"].
    household expects changes [["add: the principal use of the self-feeding bowl clamp is household use"],
        ["add: the principal use of the self-feeding bowl clamp is kitchen use"],
        ["add: the principal use of the self-feeding bowl clamp is table use"],
        ["add: the principal use of the self-feeding bowl clamp is toilet use"]].

