% NY N340223 (May 2024): a plastic mat from China.
scenario ny_n340223 is:
    the kitchen rug M516 is a manufactured article,
        as stated in ruling NY N340223 at "The article is a rectangular beige mat with three layers that measure approximately 20 inches wide by 40 inches long".
    the kitchen rug M516 is a composite good,
        as stated in ruling NY N340223 at "This item is considered to be a composite good within the meaning of General Rule of Interpretation (GRI) 3".
    the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516 is a component of the kitchen rug M516,
        as stated in ruling NY N340223 at "a rectangular beige mat with three layers that measure approximately 20 inches wide by 40 inches long".
    the rubber foam back of the kitchen rug M516 is a component of the kitchen rug M516,
        as stated in ruling NY N340223 at "The back of the mat is a polyurethane-coated fabric laminated with neoprene foam rubber".
    the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516 is made of plastics,
        according to the CBP laboratory, as stated in ruling NY N340223 at "You indicate that the external surface area of the upper is coated with polyurethane",
        because "a man-made nonwoven fabric coated, covered, impregnated or laminated with poly(ether-ester urethane)".
    the essential character of the kitchen rug M516 is given by the coated nonwoven layer of the kitchen rug M516,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N340223 at "material provides this item with the essential character within the meaning of GRI 3(b)",
        because "the coated layer performs the primary role of cushioning; the rubber back only prevents sliding".
    the principal use of the kitchen rug M516 is household use,
        according to CBP, as stated in ruling NY N340223 at "The mat is designed and marketed for household use",
        because "the mat is designed and marketed for household use".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the kitchen rug M516 is 3924.90"].

